---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import type { ImageMetadata } from 'astro';
import LessonSection from './LessonSection.astro';
import PromptCopyBlock from './PromptCopyBlock.astro';
import type { Lesson04ReviewPracticeData } from '../../lib/lesson04-workflow';
import { lesson04FinalContent } from '../../lib/lesson04-final-content';

interface Props {
  lessonId: string;
  review: Lesson04ReviewPracticeData;
}

const { lessonId, review } = Astro.props;
const materialModules = import.meta.glob<{ default: ImageMetadata }>(
  '../../assets/lessons/04/material-reference-review/*.png',
  { eager: true },
);
const materials = review.materials.map((material) => ({
  ...material,
  image: Object.entries(materialModules).find(([filePath]) => filePath.endsWith(material.fileName))?.[1].default,
}));
---

<LessonSection
  id="section-02"
  number="02"
  title="제3차시 복습 · 제안요청서(RFP)에서 디자인 기준 찾기"
  class="outline-section lesson04-review-section"
  {lessonId}
>
  <div class="review-lead">
    <span>LESSON 03 REVIEW</span>
    <p>{review.reviewSummary}</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="review-flow" aria-label="제안요청서에서 공간 콘셉트 이미지까지의 흐름">
    {review.reviewFlow.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
  </ol>

  <article class="rfp-download-card">
    <div>
      <span>EDUCATIONAL RFP · 6 PAGES</span>
      <h3>{review.rfp.title}</h3>
      <p>{review.rfp.description}</p>
      <small>{review.rfp.notice}</small>
    </div>
    <a href={review.rfp.href} download={review.rfp.downloadName}>제안요청서(RFP) 다운로드</a>
  </article>

  <div class="scope-note">
    <strong>RFP 전체 과업</strong>
    <p>네 공간 각각에 3개의 디자인 대안을 요청한다.</p>
    <strong>이번 복습 범위</strong>
    <p>A~D 중 한 공간을 선택해 Option A / B / C 세 대안을 만든다.</p>
  </div>
</LessonSection>

<LessonSection
  id="section-03"
  number="03"
  title="이번 복습에서 한 단계 더 · 재질 참고자료 활용"
  class="outline-section lesson04-review-section"
  {lessonId}
>
  <div class="review-lead review-lead--quiet">
    <span>MATERIAL LIBRARY</span>
    <h3>현장사진과 함께 사용할 재질 참고 이미지를 준비합니다.</h3>
    <p>{review.extensionSummary}</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="review-flow review-flow--extended" aria-label="재질을 포함한 디자인 대안 비교 흐름">
    {review.extensionFlow.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
  </ol>

  <div class="material-grid" aria-label="재질 참고자료 카드">
    {materials.map((material) => (
      <article class="material-card">
        {material.image && (
          <Image
            src={material.image}
            alt={`${material.name} 이름과 질감이 함께 표시된 재질 참고 이미지`}
            widths={[320, 480, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 42vw, 360px"
            format="webp"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        )}
        <div class="material-card__body">
          <span>{material.id}</span>
          <h3>{material.name}</h3>
          {material.category && <b>{material.category}</b>}
          <p>{material.description}</p>
          <small>{material.sourceVideo} · {material.timestamp}</small>
          {material.image && <a class="material-download" href={material.image.src} download={material.fileName}>재질 이미지 다운로드</a>}
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <aside class="material-caution">
    <strong>이미지로 확인할 수 있는 범위</strong>
    <p>{review.materialCaution}</p>
    <p>{review.materialRightsNote}</p>
  </aside>
</LessonSection>

<LessonSection
  id="section-04"
  number="04"
  title="복습 실습 · 제안요청서(RFP)를 읽고 디자인 3안 만들기"
  class="outline-section lesson04-review-section"
  {lessonId}
>
  <p class="practice-intro">
    전체 RFP를 한 번에 수행하지 않는다. 한 공간에서 분석 → 디자인 → 비교 과정을
    완성하는 것이 이번 복습의 목표다.
  </p>

  <ol class="review-steps">
    <li>
      <span>STEP 1</span>
      <div>
        <h3>제안요청서(RFP) 확인</h3>
        <p>네 공간의 현재 기능, 변경 요구, 유지 조건, 디자인 가능 영역과 이미지로 확인할 수 없는 내용을 찾는다.</p>
        <a href={review.rfp.href} download={review.rfp.downloadName}>RFP PDF 내려받기</a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 2</span>
      <div>
        <h3>A~D 중 대상 공간 하나 선택</h3>
        <p>처음에는 A~D 중 한 공간만 선택한다.</p>
        <div class="space-grid">
          {review.spaces.map((space) => (
            <article>
              <span>{space.id}</span>
              <h4>{space.title}</h4>
              <p>{space.focus}</p>
              <small>RFP에서 자세히 확인하기</small>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 3</span>
      <div>
        <h3>핵심 요구조건 정리</h3>
        <ol class="question-list">
          {review.requirementQuestions.map((question) => <li>{question}</li>)}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 4</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Mini Design Brief</h3>
        <dl class="mini-brief-fields">
          {review.miniBriefFields.map((field) => (
            <div><dt>{field.key}</dt><dd>{field.label}</dd></div>
          ))}
        </dl>
        <details class="sample-details">
          <summary>결과 샘플 보기 · 1층 방문객 라운지</summary>
          <p class="sample-notice">정답이 아니라 작성 형식을 보여주는 예시다.</p>
          <dl>
            {review.miniBriefSample.map((field) => (
              <div>
                <dt>{field.key}</dt>
                <dd>{field.lines.map((line) => <span>{line}</span>)}</dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
        </details>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 5</span>
      <div>
        <h3>현장사진과 재질 참고자료 준비</h3>
        <p>현장사진 1장, 필요한 재질 이미지 1~2장, Mini Design Brief를 준비한다. 재질 이미지는 위 Material Library에서 직접 내려받는다.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 6</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Design Brief 기반 이미지 제작 프롬프트 작성</h3>
        <p>현장사진 + 재질 참고 이미지 + Mini Design Brief를 Gemini 등 LLM에 입력해 Nano Banana용 최종 이미지 제작 프롬프트를 만든다.</p>
        <div class="prompt-flow" aria-label="이미지 제작 프롬프트 작성 흐름">
          <span>현장사진 + 재질 + Mini Design Brief</span><b>→</b><span>Gemini 등 LLM</span><b>→</b><span>Nano Banana용 최종 프롬프트</span><b>→</b><span>Option A / B / C</span>
        </div>
        <PromptCopyBlock
          id="lesson04-review-image-prompt"
          title="A · Gemini 등에 입력하는 요청문"
          description="입력자료의 역할과 판단 한계를 먼저 지정한다."
          prompt={lesson04FinalContent.reviewInputPrompt}
        />
        <PromptCopyBlock
          id="lesson04-review-output-prompt"
          title="B · LLM이 작성하는 Nano Banana용 최종 이미지 제작 프롬프트 샘플"
          description="무엇이 출력되고 어디에 사용하는지 보여주는 구조 샘플이다. 대괄호 안은 선택한 공간과 Option에 맞게 채운다."
          prompt={lesson04FinalContent.reviewOutputPrompt}
        />
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 7</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Option A / B / C 생성</h3>
        <p>{review.optionGuidance}</p>
        <div class="option-boundaries">
          <article><h4>공통 고정</h4><ul>{review.fixedConditions.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>
          <article><h4>변화 가능</h4><ul>{review.variableConditions.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>STEP 8</span>
      <div>
        <h3>3안 비교 및 선택</h3>
        <p>세 결과의 콘셉트, 재질과 핵심 차이를 기록한 뒤 다음 섹션의 같은 기준으로 비교한다.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</LessonSection>

<LessonSection
  id="section-05"
  number="05"
  title="복습 실습 결과 정리 · 3안 비교하기"
  class="outline-section lesson04-review-section"
  {lessonId}
>
  <div class="option-record-grid">
    {['A', 'B', 'C'].map((option) => (
      <article>
        <span>OPTION {option}</span>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Concept</dt><dd></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Material</dt><dd></dd></div>
          <div><dt>핵심 차이</dt><dd></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="comparison-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Option A, B, C 비교표">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>평가기준</th><th>Option A</th><th>Option B</th><th>Option C</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {review.comparisonCriteria.map((criterion) => (
          <tr><th scope="row">{criterion}</th><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="comparison-caution">{review.comparisonCaution}</p>

  <div class="review-results">
    <h3>복습을 마치면 정리할 결과</h3>
    <ol>{review.resultItems.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ol>
    <p>실제 After 이미지가 준비되지 않은 상태에서는 가짜 결과 이미지를 대신 넣지 않는다.</p>
  </div>

</LessonSection>

<style>
  :global(.lesson04-review-section) {
    --review-ink: #17211d;
    --review-paper: #f3efe6;
    --review-accent: #a33c25;
  }

  .review-lead {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--review-accent);
    background: var(--review-paper);
  }

  .review-lead > span,
  .rfp-download-card > div > span,
  .material-card__body > span,
  .option-record-grid > article > span {
    color: var(--review-accent);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .review-lead h3,
  .review-lead p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .review-lead h3 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .review-lead p {
    max-width: 48rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  .review-lead--quiet {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--review-accent);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .review-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.7rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: flow;
  }

  .review-flow li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 5.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    background: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.45;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }

  .review-flow li:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    right: -1.4rem;
    color: var(--review-accent);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .review-flow--extended {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .rfp-download-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--review-ink);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .rfp-download-card h3,
  .rfp-download-card p {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
  }

  .rfp-download-card small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rfp-download-card a,
  .review-steps a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--review-ink);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .rfp-download-card a:focus-visible,
  .review-steps a:focus-visible,
  .sample-details summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus, #1d4ed8);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .scope-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.6rem 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #faf8f2;
  }

  .scope-note p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .material-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .material-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 42%) minmax(0, 1fr);
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .material-card img,
  .material-card__restricted {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 16rem;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .material-card img {
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .material-card__restricted {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    color: #f6f2e9;
    background: #2a332f;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .material-card__restricted span {
    color: #d9a68f;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .material-card__restricted p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .material-card__body {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1.2rem;
  }

  .material-card__body h3,
  .material-card__body p,
  .material-card__body small {
    margin: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .material-card__body h3 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .material-card__body p,
  .material-card__body small {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .material-card__body small {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .material-card__body > b {
    color: var(--review-accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .material-download {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--review-ink);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .material-download:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus, #1d4ed8);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .material-card__body label {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--review-ink);
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .material-card__body input {
    width: 1.15rem;
    height: 1.15rem;
    accent-color: var(--review-accent);
  }

  .material-caution,
  .comparison-caution {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--review-accent);
    background: #f8eee8;
  }

  .material-caution p,
  .comparison-caution {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .practice-intro {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .prompt-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, auto);
    gap: 0.55rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .prompt-flow span {
    min-width: 10rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    background: #faf8f2;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .prompt-flow b {
    color: var(--review-accent);
  }

  .review-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .review-steps > li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }

  .review-steps > li > span {
    color: var(--review-accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .review-steps > li > div,
  .review-steps h3,
  .review-steps p {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .review-steps h3,
  .review-steps p {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .space-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .space-grid article {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #faf8f2;
  }

  .space-grid article > span {
    color: var(--review-accent);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .space-grid h4,
  .space-grid p {
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
  }

  .space-grid small {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .question-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
  }

  .mini-brief-fields,
  .sample-details dl,
  .material-form,
  .option-record-grid dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }

  .mini-brief-fields > div,
  .sample-details dl > div,
  .material-form > div,
  .option-record-grid dl > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(7rem, 0.32fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .mini-brief-fields > div:last-child,
  .sample-details dl > div:last-child,
  .material-form > div:last-child,
  .option-record-grid dl > div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mini-brief-fields dt,
  .mini-brief-fields dd,
  .sample-details dt,
  .sample-details dd,
  .material-form dt,
  .material-form dd,
  .option-record-grid dt,
  .option-record-grid dd {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .mini-brief-fields dt,
  .sample-details dt,
  .material-form dt,
  .option-record-grid dt {
    background: #f1ede4;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .material-form dd,
  .option-record-grid dd {
    min-height: 3.1rem;
  }

  .sample-details {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }

  .sample-details summary {
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #f1ede4;
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .sample-details dl,
  .sample-notice {
    margin: 1rem;
  }

  .sample-details dd span {
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .option-boundaries,
  .option-record-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .option-boundaries article,
  .option-record-grid > article {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .option-record-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

